- community: Tie the business to something happening in {{ $json.suburb }} (local events, sports teams, council news)
- behind_the_scenes: Show what it's like to work in {{ $json.suburb }} — the team, the day, the quirks
- milestone: A milestone, award, or achievement, tied to our work in {{ $json.suburb }}

