- 200–300 words
- Mention {{ $json.suburb }} at least 3 times naturally
- Include the primary keyword at least twice
- Reference at least 1 real local element (landmark, street, known characteristic)
- End with an engagement question
- NO corporate language, NO 'we pride ourselves'
- Sound like a real local business owner who works in this area every week

